{'symbol': 'WHR', 'date': '2022-12-12 08:00:00', 'title': 'WHIRLPOOL CORPORATION NAMED TO 2022 DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY WORLD INDEX', 'text': "BENTON HARBOR, MICH. , DEC. 12, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0WHIRLPOOL CORPORATION (NYSE: WHR) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS BEEN NAMED TO THE 2022 DOW JONES SUSTAINABILITY WORLD INDEX (DJSI) IN RECOGNITION OF THE COMPANY'S ONGOING FOCUS ON RESPONSIBLE AND ETHICAL BUSINESS PRACTICES."}